# Copy this file to `.env` (git ignores it) and fill in the app's own pair
# from https://my.telegram.org/apps. The build seals them into the binary;
# people who use that build are only asked for their phone number.
#
# One pair for Adelite, not one per person, and never in git: whoever has
# the hash can pass for the app and use up its quota, and Telegram gives an
# account only one.
ADELITE_TELEGRAM_API_ID=
ADELITE_TELEGRAM_API_HASH=
